confd (0.1.0-3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix Go build on PPA: set GOCACHE/GOTMPDIR to writable dirs.
  * PPA build environment uses HOME=/sbuild-nonexistent which doesn't exist.

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 15:10:00 +0800

confd (0.1.0-2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix sdbus-c++ API compatibility for noble build.
  * Remove sdbus::ServiceName and sdbus::ObjectPath types (not in noble).

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0800

confd (0.1.0-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Go-based NETCONF server backed by sysrepo.
  * Includes libyang v5.8.6, sysrepo v5.1.0, Telekom sysrepo-plugins.
  * Bundled procps v3.3.17 for os-metrics plugin (Ubuntu 26.04 compat).
  * All dependencies bundled — no network access required during build.
  * Interactive CLI shell with YAML config rendering.
  * Auto-connect to local server at launch.
  * Auto-discovery of plugins and YANG modules.

 -- Henry Mao <henry.mao@canonical.com>  Sat, 13 Sep 2026 14:00:00 +0800
